{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2704841,"ns":0,"title":"Air preheater","extract":"An air preheater is any device designed to heat air before another process (for example,  combustion in a boiler), with the primary objective of increasing the thermal efficiency of the process. They may be used alone or to replace a recuperative heat system or to replace a steam coil.","description":"Device designed to heat air before another process","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}